OL,3,GNEWSABolton food festival to attract
OL,4,A500,000 visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than half a million people are
OL,7,Fexpected to attend Bolton's Food and
OL,8,FDrink Festival as over 100 food vendors
OL,9,Fwill serve up tasty meals and drinks
OL,10,Fover four days.
OL,12,FBig name chefs include James Martin,
OL,13,FMarco Pierre White and Nisha Katona
OL,14,Fwill serve up cooking demos.
OL,16,FThe festival site is spread across the
OL,17,Ftown centre and organisers suggest
OL,18,FVictoria Square information point is
OL,19,Fthe best place for visitors to collect
OL,20,Fa free guide to help plan their day.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
