OL,3,GNEWSABolton food festival to attract
OL,4,A500,000 visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FDebbie Newall, Bolton Council's
OL,7,Fexecutive cabinet member for culture,
OL,8,Fsaid: "This is an opportunity to
OL,9,Fsupport local traders, celebrate
OL,10,Ffantastic food and drink, and showcase
OL,11,Fthe very best of Bolton."
